#: boardwidget.cpp:695
msgid "Congratulations. You have won!"
msgstr "អប​អរ​សាទរ ។ អ្នក​ឈ្នះ!"

#: boardwidget.cpp:726
msgid "Calculating new game..."
msgstr "ការ​គណនា​ល្បែង​ថ្មីណនា..."

#: boardwidget.cpp:731
msgid "Error converting board information!"
msgstr "កំហុស​ការ​បំលែង​ព័ត៌មាន​ក្តារហុស!"

#: boardwidget.cpp:758
msgid "Ready. Now it is your turn."
